# oracle: min_style hftn (Hessian-free truncated Newton) on a free Lennard-Jones cluster of about 30 atoms, perturbed, every iteration printed (the first five iterations: later rows differ from native only by floating-point rounding amplified by the finite-difference Hessian products, beyond 1e-8 at iteration 6)
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 1.1e-9, atoms 1.1e-8.
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
boundary        f f f
lattice         fcc 0.9
region          box block -4 4 -4 4 -4 4
create_box      1 box
region          sph sphere 0 0 0 1.6
create_atoms    1 region sph
mass            1 1.0
variable        dx atom 0.06*sin(3.1*x+1.7*y)
variable        dy atom 0.06*cos(2.3*y+0.9*z)
variable        dz atom 0.06*sin(1.9*z+2.5*x)
displace_atoms  all move v_dx v_dy v_dz units box
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
pair_modify     shift yes
thermo          1
thermo_style    custom step pe fmax
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
min_style       hftn
minimize        1.0e-12 1.0e-10 5 3000
